  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "sensor-state-error-hold-bound",
  "description": "an excursion open when the sensor reports an error is held, not closed, while the error lasts; after 24 hours of hold the bound reads its root as not met, reports held_too_long once, and closes it with reason hold-bound; the first reading with no error state opens a new excursion",
